        "position_hint": 0.35,
        "text": "Priya Nair, thanks for being here."
      },
      "type": "Insight"
    },
    {
      "id": "insight:2104f2725b7b11dc",
      "properties": {
        "episode_id": "3d0ec494-98ba-5f71-b2bd-c8559c779786",
        "grounded": true,
        "insight_type": "recommendation",
        "position_hint": 0.5,
        "text": "Excited for this one \u2014 incident response and on-call design is something I've been thinking about a lot."
      },
      "type": "Insight"
    },
    {
      "id": "person:speaker-02",
      "properties": {
        "name": "Priya Nair"
      },
      "type": "Person"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:d981d6acec44e30b",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 320,
        "char_start": 201,
        "episode_id": "3d0ec494-98ba-5f71-b2bd-c8559c779786",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-02",
        "text": "Thanks, Ethan. Excited for this one \u2014 incident response and on-call design is something I've been thinking about a lot.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 12000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 6000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p02_e01.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "person:speaker-01",
      "properties": {
        "name": "Ethan"
      },
      "type": "Person"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:64783792af46100a",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 466,
        "char_start": 328,
        "episode_id": "3d0ec494-98ba-5f71-b2bd-c8559c779786",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-01",
        "text": "This episode is brought to you by Linear. Linear is the issue tracker built for speed \u2014 keyboard-first. Get started at linear.com/podcast.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 18000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 12000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p02_e01.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:66f0ef6242ea7a44",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 582,
        "char_start": 479,
        "episode_id": "3d0ec494-98ba-5f71-b2bd-c8559c779786",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-02",
        "text": "I'm a believer in centralizing the security function. One team, one source of truth, one neck to wring.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 24000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 18000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p02_e01.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:065354b107d6fdbe",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 628,
        "char_start": 590,
        "episode_id": "3d0ec494-98ba-5f71-b2bd-c8559c779786",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-01",
        "text": "That's a real shift. Worth pulling on.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 30000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 24000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p02_e01.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:0060fd2a42a987e9",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 723,
        "char_start": 628,
        "episode_id": "3d0ec494-98ba-5f71-b2bd-c8559c779786",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-01",
        "text": "What does the failure mode look like? What's the version of the question that actually matters?",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 36000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 30000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p02_e01.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:9ff8393f2b0d6643",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 959,
        "char_start": 736,
        "episode_id": "3d0ec494-98ba-5f71-b2bd-c8559c779786",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-02",
        "text": "Let me give you the version I actually believe. A good on-call rotation is designed so that waking up is rare. We've seen this play out at teams using Linear. Once you internalize that, the rest of the decisions get easier.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 42000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 36000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p02_e01.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    }
